# DAY 8 — Dashboard (part 1): serve it & wire upload

**Goal:** a simple web page (no framework) that uploads a CSV to the API.

No new installs (plain HTML + JavaScript served by FastAPI).

## Person A — serve static files + enable CORS

**File: `app/main.py`** — **Edit**: add CORS and static mounting.

```python
from fastapi.middleware.cors import CORSMiddleware
from fastapi.staticfiles import StaticFiles
```
After `app = FastAPI(...)`:
```python
app.add_middleware(
    CORSMiddleware, allow_origins=["*"],
    allow_methods=["*"], allow_headers=["*"],
)
app.mount("/ui", StaticFiles(directory="static", html=True), name="ui")
```

**File: `Dockerfile`** — **Edit**: copy the static folder into the image. Add,
before the `CMD` line:
```dockerfile
COPY ./static ./static
```

## Person B — the dashboard page

**File: `static/index.html`** — **Create**.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>Sentinel Dashboard</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 900px; margin: 40px auto; color: #222; }
    h1 { color: #8C1D40; }
    .card { border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
    th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; }
    th { background: #8C1D40; color: #fff; }
    button { background: #8C1D40; color: #fff; border: 0; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; }
    .score { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Sentinel — Data Reliability</h1>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>1. Upload a CSV</h3>
    <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="dataset name" value="orders" />
    <input type="file" id="file" accept=".csv" />
    <button onclick="upload()">Upload</button>
    <p id="uploadMsg"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>2. Validate</h3>
    <p>Dataset id: <span id="dsid">—</span></p>
    <button onclick="validate()">Run validation</button>
  </div>

  <div class="card" id="reportCard" style="display:none">
    <h3>Report</h3>
    <p class="score" id="score"></p>
    <p id="counts"></p>
    <p id="common"></p>
    <h4>Quarantined rows</h4>
    <div id="quarantine"></div>
  </div>

  <script>
    const API = window.location.origin;   // same server
    let datasetId = null;

    async function upload() {
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value;
      const file = document.getElementById('file').files[0];
      if (!file) { alert('Choose a CSV first'); return; }
      const fd = new FormData();
      fd.append('file', file);
      const res = await fetch(`${API}/datasets/upload?name=${encodeURIComponent(name)}`, {
        method: 'POST', body: fd,
      });
      const data = await res.json();
      datasetId = data.dataset_id;
      document.getElementById('dsid').textContent = datasetId;
      document.getElementById('uploadMsg').textContent =
        `Ingested ${data.rows_ingested} rows.`;
    }

    async function validate() {
      if (!datasetId) { alert('Upload first'); return; }
      await fetch(`${API}/datasets/${datasetId}/validate`, { method: 'POST' });
      const report = await (await fetch(`${API}/datasets/${datasetId}/report`)).json();
      const q = await (await fetch(`${API}/datasets/${datasetId}/quarantine`)).json();

      document.getElementById('reportCard').style.display = 'block';
      document.getElementById('score').textContent = `Health: ${report.health_score}%`;
      document.getElementById('counts').textContent =
        `Total ${report.total_rows} · Valid ${report.valid} · Invalid ${report.invalid}`;
      document.getElementById('common').textContent =
        `Most common error: ${report.most_common_error || 'none'}`;

      let html = '<table><tr><th>Row</th><th>Data</th><th>Reasons</th></tr>';
      for (const row of q) {
        const reasons = row.reasons.map(r => `${r.column}: ${r.detail}`).join('; ');
        html += `<tr><td>${row.row_number}</td><td>${JSON.stringify(row.data)}</td><td>${reasons}</td></tr>`;
      }
      html += '</table>';
      document.getElementById('quarantine').innerHTML = html;
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
```

