| Engine core (`validate`, registry) | ✅ owns | adds rule functions |
| Rules: date, unique, regex | ✅ | |
| Rules: not_null, positive, in_set | | ✅ |
| Orchestrator + `/validate` | ✅ | |
| Upload / ingestion | | ✅ |
| Report + datasets list | ✅ | |
| Rules API + quarantine view | | ✅ |
| CI (GitHub Actions) | ✅ | |
| Test-data generator (Faker) | | ✅ |
| Dashboard | serve + CORS | ✅ page |
| Deploy (Render + Neon) | ✅ | README + demo |

Swap PR reviews both ways so you each understand the whole system before the review.
